TarrocoIsland_Text_1:
	.string "EEVEE is a POKéMON with several\n"
	.string "different evolution methods.\p"
	.string "It can be caught in some forest in\n"
	.string "the eastern part of the ORANGE\l"
	.string "ARCHIPELAGO.$"

TarrocoIsland_Text_2:
	.string "There used to be a lot of pirates\n"
	.string "poaching around TARROCO ISLAND.\p"
	.string "They were trying to poach herds of\n"
	.string "LAPRAS that roam around here.\p"
	.string "Lately we arrested a lot of them,\n"
	.string "therefore it’s a lot calmer around\l"
	.string "the waters of TARROCO ISLAND.$"

TarrocoIsland_Text_3:
	.string "Despite being a BUG CATCHER I love\n"
	.string "watching the sea.\p"
	.string "Sometimes even a rare herd of\n"
	.string "LAPRAS swims by TARROCO ISLAND!$"

